Version     Date            Description

1.1.0       2025-10-16      Added support for selecting multiple files and scrolling through them.
                            Added support for automatic background correction.
                            Fixed a minor bug with paged viewing of large files.

1.0.14      2025-09-23      Fix: respect system level lock orientation setting while permitting inverted portrait.
                            Perform an auto BnC when pausing live acquisition.

1.0.13      2025-09-22      Support inverted portrait mode.
                            Fails gracefully when memory is over committed.
                            Write memory information to the diagnostic log.

1.0.12      2025-09-20      Added a new setting for the time span for live mode.
                            Renamed the existing buffer size setting to maximum viewable time span.
                            Improvements to gesture responsiveness on lower spec devices.
                            Fixed a bug related to display of heterodyne markers.
                            Fixed a buffer overrun that could result in crashes.
                            Noted GPU limitations leading to jerky updates with some settings combinations.

1.0.11      2025-09-14      Handles USB timeouts, important for certain models of EMT2.
                            Set sampling rate to microphones dependent on their support for it in the descriptor.

1.0.10      2025-09-12      Reorganized the drawing of the UI so that it is OK on
                            devices with API version 30.
                            The live cursor is hidden in file viewer mode.

1.0.9       2025-09-08     Add support for reading the bmAttributes field. GUANO timestamp is now in local time with a UTC offset.

1.0.8       2025-09-05      Fixes relating to handling of the minimum heterodyne frequency.
                            Fixes relating to resolving file name collisions.
                            The trigger range can now extend down to 10 kHz.

1.0.7       2025-09-04      Improvements to the audio settings modal.
                            Bumped target API version to 36.
                            Adopted Timber logging system.

1.0.6       2025-09-03      Repeated release process for 1.0.5.
1.0.5       2025-09-03      Moved the GUANO wav file section to be after the data section, for
                            compatibility with Anabat Insight labelling.

1.0.4       2025-09-02      The heterodyne markers can now be dragged right to the top or bottom of
                            spectrogram.
                            Fixed issue with rendering the display on API version 30.
                            Included Android API number in the diagnostic log.
                            Updated apg library.

1.0.3       2025-08-28      Reading wav files now correctly skips over duplicate wav file sections,
                            avoiding errors with some files created by Titley products.
                            Fixed a regression that prevented paging of large files working properly.

1.0.2       2025-08-27      Rationalized exiting from the app.
                            The user can navigate to another app and back again with no interruption
                            to recording or audio. Tapping the back button button from the top level
                            activity will however close down the app, after a yes/no prompt.
                            Updated Android gradle plugin version.

1.0.1       2025-08-26      Audio boost is now in dB.
                            Target API is now 35 (Android 15).
                            Edge to edge mode is now used so the app can use the
                                entire screen, including around the camera.
                            The microphone sampling rate is now only set/read if more than one is
                                supported by the microphone. Previously, this was done unnecessarily
                                when only one sampling rate was available.

1.0.0       2025-08-16      Initial technical preview release.